<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/27/eng@/~chp_III__cl_12__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The amendments in paragraphs I4(a), I4(b), 14(c) and 14(d) shall be deemed to have effect for the year of assessment 1996 and subsequent years of assessment. Amendment of section 13A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/27/eng@> .
