<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_18> <https://schema.org/text> "The Sales Tax Act 1972 is amended by substituting for section 16 the following section: 16. Subject to this Act, sales tax shall be levied— . (a) on the sale value at the rate in force at the time at which the sales tax is due; or (b) on the quantity of goods sold, used or disposed of, or imported, at the rate in force at the time at which the sales tax is due.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/27/eng@> .
